  "title": "2026-08-13 / 烤乳猪",
  "summary": "by 新世界的大门",
  "content": "<p>享用酒店早餐。最近疯狂吃咸鸭蛋。</p>\n<p>更新鸿蒙系统。史诗级更新，鸿蒙键（图标就是个大嘴，<i><img alt=\"〇\"></i>）+V可呼出历史记录，和 Windows 一样。</p>\n<img src=\"https://remnote-user-data.s3.amazonaws.com/p5rg-4Dacsk5dkSLHqMHexT91ItlPB4-xFvSUl7YLX95_dyzFql-e0qbxRA2tL-tRBg9ot0VvwVuDW4bEAZHSHnLaMjGrRtadJRSXtgWQQrGroF1JjXtnctsg9i7RHvC.jpg\" alt=\"\">\n<p>夜晚，吃烤乳猪。这是我第一次吃烤乳猪。相比之下，还是 Schweinshaxe 更合我胃口。</p>\n<img src=\"https://remnote-user-data.s3.amazonaws.com/RW46v_otPAR485R-p3cFbGEkpwlUcake8us22ENgTvwH-l_P4-BOm-iUfzDlLpr0rjOO-v3a3-OR-RqEs5GXZvkyybzbgYX-1U0R9DSfKXa0tXeYDCv0PfZmTSp_upjR.jpg\" alt=\"\">",
